github.setup        Mattbusel tokio-prompt-orchestrator 2.4.1 v
github.tarball_from archive
name                tokio-prompt-orchestrator
revision            0
categories          devel net
installs_libs       no
license             MIT
maintainers         {tensorust.com:mattbusel @Mattbusel} \
                    openmaintainer

description         Local proxy that deduplicates LLM API calls and fails fast on outages

long_description    {*}${description}. orchestrator sits in front of OpenAI, \
                    Anthropic and OpenAI-compatible APIs as a local HTTP \
                    server: identical prompts in flight share one upstream \
                    call, a circuit breaker stops requests to a provider that \
                    is down, and queue, cost and cache metrics are exported \
                    for Prometheus.

checksums           ${distname}${extract.suffix} \
